        "text": "10 cm"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Find the small rectangle",
        "body": "Two flat rectangles are stacked and together are as tall as one upright rectangle, so the long side of a small rectangle is twice the short side: $2\\times10=20$ cm. The large rectangle is made of an upright rectangle on each side and the flat ones in the middle, so its longer side is $10+20+10=40$ cm.\n\n**Answer: (B) 40 cm**"
      }
    ],
